   <narrative xml:lang="SV">1 Article 19 &#xE4;r en Londonbaserad globalt verksam NGO som arbetar f&#xF6;r att fr&#xE4;mja yttrande- och informationsfrihet. Deras k&#xE4;rnkompetens r&#xF6;r yttrandefrihet och medielagstiftning samt standardutveckling och r&#xE4;ttsprocesser. A19 bevakar, forskar, publicerar, driver  r&#xE4;ttsprocesser, lobbar, bygger kapacitet och kampanjar inom  yttradefrihetsomr&#xE5;det och mediautveckling. Sidast&#xF6;d sedan 1990-tal.</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">ARTICLE 19 is a UK-based, internationally working NGO, working for the defence of freedom of expression and the freedom of information globally. Its core competence is in the legal and political areas of standard-setting and litigation. Another strength is its innovative policy development. It monitors, researches, publishes, litigates, lobbies, builds capacity and campaigns on behalf of freedom of exp.</narrative>
